{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set collared = get_nearby_collared_actors(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_actors(npc.UUID) %}
{{speakingNpc.name}} hands a nearby collared person's existing leash to someone else, or to None to drop it and leave it hanging. Not for tying it to a point, and not for taking the leash off.
Collared targets: {{ collared.actorsNameString }}. Receivers: {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}, or None. Never pick a receiver who is the collared target. Never pick anyone not listed except None.
